payment as specified in paragraph PAYMENT, subparagraph INSTALLATION OF [GROUTED] HELICAL PILES.  Reinstallation of pulled undamaged [grouted] 
helical piles will be measured for payment as specified in paragraph PAYMENT, subparagraph INSTALLATION OF [GROUTED] HELICAL PILES.  New load test 
